<node id="11114669" title="Re^4: $VERSION in module files" created="2020-03-26 08:25:29" updated="2020-03-26 08:25:29" _doctext_mode="strict"><type id="11">note</type>
<author id="830549">haukex</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;
&lt;c&gt;
package Foo;
our $VERSION = '1.01';
# ...
package Foo::Bar;
use Foo;
our $VERSION = $Foo::VERSION;
&lt;/c&gt;
&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If that's in a single file that may work, I'm not sure, however, I suspect at least some of the tools that rely on a static parse won't be able to handle that.&lt;/p&gt;
</doctext>
